All done.

- Implemented `src/donkey/domain/channels/wechat_pure.nim` — pure XML parser for WeChat/WeCom messages
- 28 tests covering text, image, voice, video, shortvideo, file (WeCom), event (subscribe/CLICK/SCAN), plain tags, edge cases, and `toInbound`/predicates
- All 63 tests pass, 0 failures

Key design decisions:
- `extractTag(tag, xml)` has xml as last arg for `|>->` piping
- `wck` prefix avoids enum collision with WhatsApp's `wmk` prefix
- `shortvideo` maps to `wckVideo` — no separate kind needed
- Event messages have empty `msgId` (WeChat XML doesn't include MsgId for events)

